'''Potions''' are consumable liquids which are brewed in {{item|Brewing Stand}}s, granting '''Potion Effects''' when consumed. '''Potion Effects''' are effects that grants the player positive effects and stat boosts (known as {{Green|'''Buffs'''}}) or negative effects and stats (known as {{Red|'''Debuffs'''}}).


{{/TOC}}
{{Toc}}

== Brewing ==
A {{Item|Brewing Stand}} is required to make potions, and it can be bought from the {{NPCSprite|Alchemist}} for {{c|30}} each, or crafted with {{Item|Cobblestone|amount=3}} and {{Item|Blaze Rod|amount=1}}.

Potion brewing is similar to vanilla brewing in the following ways:
*{{Item|Nether Wart}} turns {{item|Water Bottle}}s into {{Item|Awkward Potion}}s;
* {{Item|Glowstone Dust}} increases its potency;
* {{Item|Redstone Dust}} increases its duration;
* {{Item|Gunpowder}} turns ''Drunkable'' Potions in their ''Splash'' variant.
There are some notable differences to how brewing works in [[SkyBlock]], such as:
* Brewing does {{red|not}} require {{Item|Blaze Powder}};
* {{item|Glowstone Dust|text=Glowstone upgrades}} and {{item|Redstone Dust|text=Redstone upgrades}} {{green|can}} be stacked on each other, but only one of each kind;
* Enchanted ingredients will result in stronger and/or longer potions.
* Potion duration is affected by the brewer's {{Skl|Alchemy}} Level;
* The brewing stand uses a custom UI:
** Potions are brewed by placing [[File:Water Bottle.png|21px|link=]] Bottles or [[Brews]] in the lower slots;
** Ingredients are placed in the upper slot. 
** When a potion is brewing, the glass panes in the middle will flash orange and yellow. After {{green|20}} seconds, the potion will finish brewing ;
Most potions last {{green|3}} minutes by default, which is increased by {{Skill|alchemy}} Level or [[File:Redstone Dust.png|21px|link=]] [[File:Enchanted Redstone Dust.png|21px|link=]] [[File:Enchanted Redstone Block.png|21px|link=]] {{red|Redstone}} ingredients, including the {{item|Enchanted Redstone Lamp}}. 
The default level of the potions depends on the base ingredient; enchanted forms give a higher base level, including the {{item|Enchanted Redstone Lamp}}.

