== Potions and Effects ==
* Potions give time-limited {{Green|'''Buffs'''}} (positive effects and stat boosts) or {{Red|'''Debuffs'''}} (negative effects and stats) when used. 
* Potions do not stack. 
* Using a potion will set both the timer and level of that effect, to match that potion's ones, with {{green|2}} exceptions:
** The drunk Potion grants a Potion Effect of a lower level than the active one;
** The drunk Potion is a {{Item|God Potion}}, which takes precedence over all other {{Green|'''Buff'''}} effects, and cannot be altered by taking a different duration nor level {{Green|'''Buff'''}} potion.
* Entering {{Zone|The Catacombs}} pauses and stores all existing potion effects the player has. The player can then receive potion buffs separately within, but only {{green|1}} Potion may be consumed or splashed per instance.
* The {{item|God Potion}} grants most {{Green|'''Buffs'''}} at their maximum level to players for {{green|12}} → {{green|24}} hours depending on their {{Skill|Alchemy}} level, and up to {{green|≈29}} hours with a {{item|Parrot Pet|rarity=legendary}}.

