=== {{TA|Skill XP}} Boost Potions ===
{{Sectionstub|This is barebone}}
These Potions can be obtained from [[File:White Gift.png|21px|link=]][[File:Green Gift.png|21px|link=]][[File:Red Gift.png|21px|link=]][[File:Party Gift.png|21px|link=]] [[Gift]]s. Each of these Potions' base attributes give {{stat|wisdom|5}} for {{green|12}} minutes at Level {{romnum|I}}, {{stat|wisdom|10}} for {{green|24}} minutes at Level {{romnum|II}}, and {{stat|wisdom|20}} for {{green|36}} minutes at Level {{romnum|III}}.
* Attempting to modify these on their own will result in the {{item|Brewing Stand}} not activating. 
* At least one unmodified of these must also be on the {{item|Brewing Stand}} for modifiers to apply. 

Redstone and Enchanted Redstone Dust cannot affect Skill XP Boost Potions.

Glowstone will increment an unmodified Skill XP Boost Potion's level by 1 (up to a maximum of level III), but will '''not''' affect the Potion's duration. Enchanted Glowstone will increment an unmodified Skill XP Boost Potion's level by 2 (up to a maximum of Level III), but will '''not''' affect the Potion's duration.

An Enchanted Redstone Lamp will change an unmodified Skill XP Boost Potion in the following ways:
The Potion's level will be increased to/kept at III with a {{stat|wisdom|20}} boost effect.
The Potion's duration will be set to 36 minutes '''plus''' the brewer's Alchemy level bonus.

