== Tips ==
*The {{Item|Potion Bag}} can be used to store potions and [[Mixins]], up to 45 at a time at the Massive tier.
*A {{item|Witch Pet}} can reduce the time of brewing Potions, down to {{green|10}} seconds.
*{{Item|Haste Potion}}s function differently on the {{Zone|Private Island}}, granting the vanilla {{EffectLink|Haste}} effect.
*Some modifiers require a specific order to avoid issues:
**{{LinkImage|Enchanted Gunpowder}} must be added ''after'' a duration modifier - applying it before will not activate its special effect, thus removing any benefit from using the Enchanted Gunpowder instead of normal Gunpowder.
**If using both the {{LinkImage|Enchanted Redstone Block}} and {{LinkImage|Enchanted Redstone Lamp}} (but only for level increase, due to it's cheaper price), the Enchanted Redstone Block must be added '''<u>first</u>'''; doing it in the reverse will cause no extra effect. This is because the Lamp will fill both the duration and modifier slots once use, preventing a second modifier to be applied - but applying the duration modifier first allows the Lamp to only fill up the available level modifier.
**The current value for {{LinkImage|Enchanted Redstone Lamp}} is {{BZC|1 Enchanted Redstone Lamp}} and {{LinkImage|Enchanted Glowstone}} is {{BZC|1 Enchanted Glowstone}}. (Be sure to double-check the market price before buying).

*Currently, the best method of gaining [[Alchemy]] XP is brewing {{Item|Speed Potion}}s with {{Item|Enchanted Sugar Cane}} or brewing {{Item|Weakness Potion}}s with {{ItemDisplay|Enchanted Fermented Spider Eye}}. One [[Enchanted Sugar Cane]]/[[Enchanted Fermented Spider Eye]] yields 45,000 Alchemy Experience (15,000 per potion) and while [[Speed Potion]]<nowiki/>s with normal [[Glowstone Dust|Glowstone]] sell for 13k total, [[Weakness Potion|Weakness Potions]] with [[Glowstone Dust|Glowstone]] sell for 39k total.

